主背景渐变 
background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F2EAE3 0%, #FCD0A6 50%, #F2EAE3 100%);

 装饰性背景图案 
background-image: 
radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(195, 158, 52, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(157, 180, 247, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);

/* 获奖者信息区域渐变 */
background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(157, 180, 247, 0.1), rgba(252, 208, 166, 0.1));

金边装饰
```css
/* 主框架金边 */
border: 4px solid #C39E34;
box-shadow: 
0 0 0 8px rgba(191, 111, 65, 0.2),
0 20px 40px rgba(30, 39, 38, 0.15),
inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(195, 158, 52, 0.3);

/* 角落装饰花纹 */
background: radial-gradient(circle, #C39E34 30%, transparent 31%),
conic-gradient(from 0deg, #C39E34, #BF6F41, #C39E34);
border-radius: 50%;
```

圆角设计
```css
/* 主框架圆角 */
border-radius: 20px;

/* 子区域圆角 */
border-radius: 15px;

/* 装饰元素圆角 */
border-radius: 50%;
```

阴影效果
```css
/* 主框架阴影 */
box-shadow: 
0 0 0 8px rgba(191, 111, 65, 0.2),
0 20px 40px rgba(30, 39, 38, 0.15),
inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(195, 158, 52, 0.3);

/* 文字阴影 */
text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(30, 39, 38, 0.2);
```

动画效果
```css
/* 淡入动画 */
animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease-out;

@keyframes fadeIn {
from {
opacity: 0;
transform: translateY(30px);
}
to {
opacity: 1;
transform: translateY(0);
}
}

/* 闪烁装饰动画 */
animation: sparkle 3s infinite ease-in-out;

@keyframes sparkle {
0%, 100% {
transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg);
opacity: 0.8;
}
50% {
transform: scale(1.1) rotate(180deg);
opacity: 1;
}
}
```

响应式断点
```css
/* 移动端适配 */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
.award-name { font-size: 2.2rem; }
.winner-name { font-size: 1.8rem; }
.speech-text { font-size: 1.1rem; }
.main-frame { padding: 30px 25px; }
}
```

关键设计元素位置
```css
/* 引号装饰 */
content: '"';
font-size: 4rem;
color: #9DB4F7;
position: absolute;

/* 奖杯图标 */
content: '🏆';
position: absolute;
top: -20px;
left: 50%;
transform: translateX(-50%);

/* 花纹装饰 */
content: '❋';
font-size: 24px;
color: #1E2726;
```

